            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Theodosius I</strong><br>\nTheodosius I, also known as Theodosius the Great, was born on January 11, 347 AD, in Hispania (now Spain). He was the son of Theodosius the Elder, a senior military officer, and his education emphasized both military training and Christian piety. His early life prepared him for the challenges of ruling the complex and sprawling Roman Empire which he would later inherit.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Rise to Power</strong><br>\nTheodosius became emperor of the Eastern Roman Empire in 379 AD, after the death of Emperor Valens. Valens had died at the Battle of Adrianople, a devastating defeat for the Romans at the hands of the Goths. Emperor Gratian, ruling the West, appointed Theodosius as co-emperor, recognizing his military ability and leadership qualities.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Religious Policies</strong><br>\nTheodosius was a staunch defender of orthodox Nicene Christianity. He took measures to suppress other Christian sects that he considered heretical. In 380 AD, he issued the Edict of Thessalonica, which declared Nicene Christianity the official state religion of the empire, relegating all other Christian sects and pagan practices.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
